---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Nav from '../../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
import CourseEligibilityFinder from '../../components/CourseEligibilityFinder.astro';
const title = 'PCB Career Options Without NEET Finder | Future Career School';
const description = 'Compare PCB and BiPC course routes that do not use NEET as the selected entrance route, with subject checks, official starting pages and clear limits.';
const canonical = 'https://futurecareerschool.com/tools/pcb-career-options-without-neet/';
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical}>
  <Nav /><main class="tool-page"><div class="tool-shell">
    <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">›</span><a href="/career-resources/">Career resources</a><span aria-hidden="true">›</span><span aria-current="page">PCB without NEET finder</span></nav>
    <p class="eyebrow">INTERACTIVE COURSE SCREENING TOOL</p><h1>What can PCB students choose after 12th without NEET?</h1>
    <p class="lead">Use this focused view to compare non-NEET route families such as computing, management, law, design, agriculture, hospitality and skill-first options. It also shows the documented Telangana state B.Sc. Nursing route separately from the broader NEET-tagged nursing record. It does not claim that every college in a route accepts every PCB subject combination.</p>
    <CourseEligibilityFinder initialPreset="bipc-no-neet" heading="PCB / BiPC options without NEET" />
    <section class="tool-notes"><h2>What “without NEET” means here</h2><p>This screen removes records tagged with NEET UG as a common entrance route, while preserving separately documented state-specific routes such as Telangana B.Sc. Nursing. It is a research shortlist, not a guarantee that a particular college, state process or regulated profession is open without NEET.</p><p><a href="/tools/bipc-pcb-course-finder/">Compare the full BiPC / PCB finder</a> · <a href="/blog/college-degrees/courses-for-pcb-bipc-biology-students-after-12th-without-neet/">Read the PCB/BiPC options guide</a> · <a href="/blog/career-options/career-chart-after-12th/">Compare the full after-12th chart</a></p></section>
  </div></main><Footer />
</BaseLayout>
<style>
  .tool-page{min-height:70vh;padding:4rem 1.2rem;background:radial-gradient(circle at 20% 0%,rgba(18,154,141,.12),transparent 35%),#080c18}.tool-shell{max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto}.breadcrumb{display:flex;gap:.55rem;flex-wrap:wrap;color:rgba(255,255,255,.55);font-size:.85rem;margin-bottom:2.5rem}.breadcrumb a,.tool-notes a{color:#8de4d8;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:2px}.eyebrow{color:#e5b84a;font-size:.8rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.12em}.tool-page h1{font-size:clamp(2rem,5vw,4rem);margin:.65rem 0 1rem;color:#fff}.lead{max-width:780px;font-size:1.15rem;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,.76)}.tool-notes{margin-top:2rem;padding:1.2rem;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15);border-radius:16px;color:rgba(255,255,255,.75);line-height:1.7}.tool-notes h2{color:#fff}
</style>
